  Design: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ad98d117e8a7344a1b68779f8bb1b3fa, type: 2}
  DesignerSolution: "T\u1ED5ng h\u1EE3p \u0111i\u1EC1u h\u01B0\u1EDBng, ch\u1ECDn
    nh\xE1nh v\xE0 \u0111\u1ED5i m\u1EB7t \u0111\u1EE1 \u0111\xE3 luy\u1EC7n d\u01B0\u1EDBi
    n\u01B0\u1EDBc; kh\xF4ng th\xEAm c\u1EEDa \u0111\u1ED9ng ho\u1EB7c lu\u1ED3ng
    n\u01B0\u1EDBc. B\u1ED1 tr\xED: P13 + P11 + P15 \u2014 m\u1ED9t bi, ba s\xE2n
    n\u01B0\u1EDBc n\u1ED1i b\u1EB1ng \u0111\u1ECBa h\xECnh c\u1ED1 \u0111\u1ECBnh
    v\xE0 \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng quanh ph\xF9 \u0111i\xEAu.\nRecovery: M\u1ED7i v\xF9ng
    c\xF3 s\xE2n h\u1EE9ng ri\xEAng; \xE1nh s\xE1ng v\xE0 VFX gi\u1EEF bi r\xF5;
    kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i ch\u1EDD bi tr\xF4i m\u1ED9t qu\xE3ng d\xE0i \u0111\u1EC3
    th\u1EED l\u1EA1i"
